dfe6', '01b0515d29715cc0', '5feb9ed287d16e8d', '1c5a22e30f3288bc', '10e1aae4e1634e2c', 'a1f74305ec92966d', 'b824888249a028b5'], 'raw_excerpts': [{'signal_id': '504789077c3e2db9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Fighting in Ethiopia and the Risk of Regional Spillover <p>In September, fighting broke out in Ethiopia&#8217;s Tigray region between Ethiopian government forces and the Tigray People&#8217;s Liberation Front (TPLF), effectively collapsing the 2022 peace deal. In October, Ethiopi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/fighting-in-ethiopia-and-the-risk-of-regional-spillover/'}, {'signal_id': '96067be01a3925c0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Establishing Battery Supply Chain Resilience for Drones <p>Militaries have spent more than a century operating with fuel and ammunition as limits of combat endurance. They are only beginning to treat batteries with the same operational seriousness, as small unmanned systems move ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/establishing-battery-supply-chain-resilience-for-drones/'}, {'signal_id': '46c8ac1798543095', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Tehran is a Different Beast Now <p>The Tehran that the world knew is gone. It died in the fires with former Supreme Leader Ali Khamenei on the first day of the war in February. His son and new Supreme Leader, Mojtaba Khamenei &#8212; wherever he is and in whatever physical condit', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/tehran-is-a-different-beast-now/'}, {'signal_id': '20959e0f322e0b35', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Reading Pyongyang Through the Cracks of the International System <p>In 2023, three North Korea analysts identified what they believe most people studying the country get wrong, and how analysts can avoid those traps. Three years later, we asked them to revisit their arguments and', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/reading-pyongyang-through-the-cracks-of-the-international-system/'}, {'signal_id': '6b33ec26d149c8cf', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Guns, Growth, and the German Reinvention of Military Keynesianism <p>In March 2025, Germany did more than loosen a fiscal rule. It fused two national emergencies &#8212; a deteriorating European security order and a deteriorating industrial model &#8212; into a single constitutio', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/guns-growth-and-the-german-reinvention-of-military-keynesianism/'}, {'signal_id': '42dd74dd00ec1072', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'In Skepticism We Trust: Ukraine Reacts to the Diesel Deal <p>Welcome to The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum only for War on the Rocks members. Each week, we bring you a curated selection of articles from Ukr', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/in-skepticism-we-trust-ukraine-reacts-to-the-diesel-deal/'}, {'signal_id': 'f38841d29de98b9b', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Pentagon Doesn’t Need to Reinvent Supply Chain Transparency <p>As the United States seeks to rebuild its defense industrial base, Washington is scrambling to understand an industrial ecosystem that it no longer controls, nor largely understands. China has been able to achieve', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-pentagon-doesnt-need-to-reinvent-supply-chain-transparency/'}, {'signal_id': 'e17b18b4e6f080a9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'March Separately, Strike Combined: Rethinking Mass and Maneuver on the Transparent Battlefield <p>Between May 10 and 13, 1940, German Panzer Group Kleist advanced through the densely wooded Ardennes Forest, which the French considered impenetrable to large, mechanized formations.', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/march-separately-strike-combined-rethinking-mass-and-maneuver-on-the-transparent-battlefield/'}, {'signal_id': '3df0b9933c5c95ea', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'China’s Strategic Reassessment of India <p>As China and India have improved their relations in recent months, many observers have attributed this improvement to the end of U.S. strategic altruism toward India. Indeed, in the past year, China has watched India lose its balance and', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/chinas-strategic-reassessment-of-india/'}, {'signal_id': '617aa970b2e89f29', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Do the Benefits Outweigh the Risks of Hosting U.S. Military Bases? <p>Since the end of World War II, the United States has maintained hundreds of military installations abroad. While U.S. forces have faced some objections to their presence, many allies and partners have seen U.S.', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/do-the-benefits-outweigh-the-risks-of-hosting-u-s-military-bases/'}, {'signal_id': 'd5b6daf0837c1f71', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Golden Dome Is Technologically and Financially Infeasible <p>For as long as nuclear-armed, intercontinental ballistic missiles and submarine-launched ballistic missiles have existed, strategists and engineers have pursued a seductive idea: a shield effective enough to diminish &#', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/golden-dome-is-technologically-and-financially-infeasible/'}, {'signal_id': '385dbb7b1febdab2', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How Sudan Became a Laboratory for Drone Warfare, Thanks to Abu Dhabi <p>In June 2026, I visited Khartoum, my hometown, for the first time since the war broke out in Sudan in April 2023. I left the city to seek safety with my family after the war spread into civilian neighborhoods', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-sudan-became-a-laboratory-for-drone-warfare-thanks-to-abu-dhabi/'}, {'signal_id': 'be056ebaa30940a5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'China’s Military Expansion in Southeast Asia Masks a More Complicated Reality <p>The Chinese Ministry of Defense&#8217;s announcement of a &#8220;joint support and training center&#8221; at an airport in Ban Keun, Laos, on Sept. 29 drew attention to the People&#8217;s Liberation ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/chinas-military-expansion-in-southeast-asia-masks-a-more-complicated-reality/'}, {'signal_id': 'c0b56a464ff0fa86', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Paradox of Victory: When Winning in Ukraine Raises the Nuclear Stakes <p>In 2022, Jeremy Shapiro warned in &#8220;We Are on a Path to Nuclear War&#8221; that the war between Russia and Ukraine was heading toward nuclear escalation. Four years into the war, we asked him to rev', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-paradox-of-victory-when-winning-in-ukraine-raises-the-nuclear-stakes/'}, {'signal_id': 'aaef8b51076309dd', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Mecca Pact and Pakistan’s Bid to Become Indispensable <p>For most of its history, Pakistan&#8217;s geopolitical value has risen and fallen with other countries&#8217; emergencies. The Mecca Pact may be its most serious attempt yet to break that cycle. On Aug. 31, Pakistan, Sa', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-mecca-pact-and-pakistans-bid-to-become-indispensable/'}, {'signal_id': 'a09f9210922c4317', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The United Kingdom’s Military AI Ambitions Need Guardrails <p>Advancing military AI capability is a priority for the United Kingdom, and in recent weeks, the new government has doubled down on its ambitions for AI and defense via two major partnerships.On Aug. 24, 2026, on his fi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-united-kingdoms-military-ai-ambitions-need-guardrails/'}, {'signal_id': 'fa838cb21199abde', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Doubts Grow Over the Terms of Ukraine’s European Union Accession <p>Welcome to The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum only for War on the Rocks members. Each week, we bring you a curated selection of articles f', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/doubts-grow-over-the-terms-of-ukraines-european-union-accession/'}, {'signal_id': '8ded31cffa7a1796', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Building an Arsenal That Survives the Tenth Salvo <p>America faces a well-defined industrial base problem. Whether it&#8217;s a hypothetical Taiwan invasion wargame run two dozen times, the current Iranian conflict, or the Russo-Ukrainian War, the same result repeats: Magazines o', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/building-an-arsenal-that-survives-the-tenth-salvo/'}, {'signal_id': 'de027184fb55a1b7', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How Taiwan Activates Beijing’s Chosen Fear <p>The standard explanations for why Taiwan is so important to the Chinese Communist Party are familiar: territorial integrity, credibility of deterrence commitments, great power competition with the United States, the strategic value of', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-taiwan-activates-beijings-chosen-fear/'}, {'signal_id': '349c62e476be9673', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Ground Robots Are Arriving on the Front Lines <p>For years, ground autonomy lagged well behind its counterparts in the air. That gap is starting to close. Jonathan is joined by Ryan Hartman (Ondas Sentinel) and Scott Philips (Forterra) to examine what it takes to field autonomous', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/ground-robots-are-arriving-on-the-front-lines/'}, {'signal_id': '97d6bef2c944be24', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How China and America Can Move from Competition to Stability <p>The American team thought it was signaling restraint. The Chinese team saw preparations for combat. In a closed-door Sino-American crisis simulation I helped organize in the 2010s &#8212; which the U.S. military fund', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-china-and-america-can-move-from-competition-to-stability/'}, {'signal_id': '2142be6d8782effc', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Shows of Strength and Signs of Strain <p>Welcome to The Adversarial.&#160;Every other week, we&#8217;ll provide you with expert analysis on America&#8217;s greatest challengers: China, Russia, Iran, North Korea, and jihadists. Read more below.***IranIn late September, U.S. and Ir', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/shows-of-strength-and-signs-of-strain/'}, {'signal_id': 'fe074f4791904e96', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Last Mile of Pentagon Reform Runs Through the Brigade <p>A kill chain measured in seconds cannot depend on processes measured in weeks or months. The Pentagon recognizes that drone proliferation and AI-enabled lethal targeting are reducing decision cycles and increasing the p', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-last-mile-of-pentagon-reform-runs-through-the-brigade/'}, {'signal_id': '9e96443e4397e990', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Fornication in America: Trump’s Arch, Rome’s Emperors, and the Meaning of Victory <p>In 79 A.D., Gaius Plinius Secundus, known today as Pliny the Elder, was the supreme commander of the Roman imperial fleet, permanently stationed at Misenum near Naples. He died during the eruptio', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/fornication-in-america-trumps-arch-romes-emperors-and-the-meaning-of-victory/'}, {'signal_id': '37973df28de692e9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Ten Wartime Technologies at America’s 250th <p>For America&#8217;s 250th anniversary, Cogs of War ran ten essays on innovations forged in wartime that subsequently diffused throughout the civilian economy, or had a lasting impact on society, governance, and Americans&#8217; relat', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/ten-wartime-technologies-at-americas-250th/'}, {'signal_id': '95001aa2838eec83', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Achieving Breakthrough: Maneuver Warfare in the Face of Robotic Mass <p>In 1914, European armies entered a war with forces designed to move. Within months, they were digging themselves into the earth. Fires from newly introduced machine guns and heavy artillery made movement acro', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/achieving-breakthrough-maneuver-warfare-in-the-face-of-robotic-mass/'}, {'signal_id': '331261e4ad7f06d4', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Atlantic Brief: U.S. and European Perspectives on Nuclear Deterrence <p>For this edition of The Atlantic Brief, the Royal United Services Institute and War on the Rocks&#160;present a dialogue on U.S. and European Perspectives on Nuclear Deterrence. Participating experts from', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-atlantic-brief-u-s-and-european-perspectives-on-nuclear-deterrence/'}, {'signal_id': '7921e76d296a7392', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Navy’s Missing Welders Are Stocking Shelves <p>The U.S. Navy&#8217;s May 2026 shipbuilding plan, signed by Acting Secretary of the Navy Hung Cao, uses the word &#8220;innovative&#8221; eight times. The plan applies that word, among other things, to the Columbia-class submarin', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-navys-missing-welders-are-stocking-shelves/'}, {'signal_id': '8c6201e96e6b306c', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How to Defend Against AI-Designed Viruses <p>Anthropic recently disclosed five cases in which users hid their countries while asking Claude for help enhancing pathogens or toxins. This added fuel to the ongoing debate over whether progress in AI should be slowed. Insider warnings', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-to-defend-against-ai-designed-viruses/'}, {'signal_id': '3ca818d583ea279f', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Kindling, Catalyst, and Containment: Will the West Bank Ignite? <p>As violence by Israeli settlers against Palestinians in the West Bank has escalated, often with the acquiescence or support of Israel&#8217;s military, and the Israeli government has increasingly constricted Pales', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/kindling-catalyst-and-containment-will-the-west-bank-ignite/'}, {'signal_id': '03792df1e729c0f5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Iran Faces Severe Challenges to Rebuild Missile and Drone Production <p>With the significant Israeli and U.S. military attacks against Iran in 2025 and early 2026, analysts have discussed and debated Iran&#8217;s ability to replenish its missile and drone arsenal. Since 2024, Ira', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/iran-faces-severe-challenges-to-rebuild-missile-and-drone-production/'}, {'signal_id': 'bf95a3eab8eaeec8', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Certainty is a Luxury Ukrainians Must Create <p>Welcome to The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum only for War on the Rocks members. Each week, we bring you a curated selection of articles from Ukrainian media ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/certainty-is-a-luxury-ukrainians-must-create/'}, {'signal_id': '34c61349bef94190', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The AI-Assisted Strategic Own Goal in the Kill Chain <p>For eighty years, the Western alliance has anchored its strength in moral legitimacy, shared values, and the resulting credibility to shape international norms. NATO&#8217;s durability through the Cold War rested on more tha', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-ai-assisted-strategic-own-goal-in-the-kill-chain/'}, {'signal_id': '6fd1b54571dd307e', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'China is Watching Us. Is the U.S. Air Force Still Watching China? <p>On Oct. 1, 2026, Beijing celebrated the 77th anniversary of the founding of the People&#8217;s Republic of China and the beginning of the end for the U.S. Air University&#8217;s China Aerospace Studies Institute', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/china-is-watching-us-is-the-u-s-air-force-still-watching-china/'}, {'signal_id': 'f14a768f856c30e1', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How Closed Airspace Threatens U.S. Military Mobility Across Eurasia <p>For much of the modern aviation era, geography was something the global aviation industry learned to overcome. Simply put, unlike a railway, a pipeline, or a highway, an aircraft does not require a continuous ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-closed-airspace-threatens-u-s-military-mobility-across-eurasia/'}, {'signal_id': '232076be356a5cd0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Cyber Operators Are Deployed in Place. The Pentagon Should Treat Them That Way <p>A cyber operator can spend a shift tracking an adversary halfway around the world, walk to the parking lot, and be home in time for dinner. There is no flight home, no demobilization, and no transit', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cyber-operators-are-deployed-in-place-the-pentagon-should-treat-them-that-way/'}, {'signal_id': 'd83d6b856b81bcf7', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Jaw-Jaw With Belarus, Revisited Amid Ukraine War <p>In 2021, Michael Kimmage wrote, &#8220;Belarus and the Ukraine Trap,&#8221; where he argued the United States should adopt a realistic diplomatic relationship with Belarus that takes into account its strategic partnership with R', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/jaw-jaw-with-belarus-revisited-amid-ukraine-war/'}, {'signal_id': '1f5bf250f385a141', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'MacGyver at Scale: Winning Future Air Wars of Rapid Technological Adaptation <p>During a recent training exercise in the western Pacific, a small group of engineers single-handedly saved the day.In the scenario, adversary covert forces used first-person view drones to intercept A', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/macgyver-at-scale-winning-future-air-wars-of-rapid-technological-adaptation/'}, {'signal_id': 'b47e77fcce435135', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'School of War or School of Battle? Educating for an Uncertain Future <p>In 1901, military analyst Jan Bloch declared that new milit