.com/why-the-weeks-most-important-story-went-unwritten/'}, {'signal_id': '5f06bd2df0b6d0ab', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Collective Defense in an Era of Tokens and Data Links <p>NATO&#8217;s Supreme Allied Commander Transformation, Adm. Pierre Vandier, returns to the studio to discuss how the alliance is continuously adapting to a new era of warfare driven by software, data, and uncrewed systems, a', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/collective-defense-in-an-era-of-tokens-and-data-links/'}, {'signal_id': 'd1016e746dc68955', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Speed to Fielding Is Not Speed to Combat Power <p>I spent more than 20 years in U.S. Army air defense, much of it in cramped control stations where the difference between a successful engagement and a catastrophic loss came down to the soldier at the console. The radar did its jo', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/speed-to-fielding-is-not-speed-to-combat-power/'}, {'signal_id': 'ec28565eed6fe31f', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Tracing the Future Soldier’s Tech Stack <p>Movies, shows, and books have long been at the forefront of imagining the future of war. If you were to picture the &#8220;future soldier,&#8221; you&#8217;d likely picture the genetically engineered super soldiers that have captivated &', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/tracing-the-future-soldiers-tech-stack/'}, {'signal_id': '21c9c6c673f0bf7e', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'North Korea’s Irregular Warfare After Ukraine <p>Pyongyang has a long history of conducting irregular warfare and asymmetric operations: Look no further than the 1968 Blue House raid or the 1996 submarine incursion as the most pressing examples. More often than not, North Korea f', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/north-koreas-irregular-warfare-after-ukraine/'}, {'signal_id': '259ceb6b0e5126a0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Power, Prudence, and Restraint in Fénelon’s