ed, to the', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/washingtons-foreign-equity-bets-need-better-governance/'}, {'signal_id': '6cd84c792977536e', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Only America Could Have Designed the Field Jacket <p>When the M-1943 field jacket was introduced at the height of World War II, it was a revolutionary garment. The jacket was the result of rigorous testing, input from an astonishingly diverse group of experts, and was produced by', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/only-america-could-have-designed-the-field-jacket/'}, {'signal_id': '6fa782126a98f2f9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Pressure Points <p>Welcome to The Adversarial.&#160;Every other week, we&#8217;ll provide you with expert analysis on America&#8217;s greatest challengers: China, Russia, Iran, North Korea, and jihadists. Read more below.***IranSenior officials from Iran, Oman, and neighboring Gu', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/pressure-points/'}, {'signal_id': 'b35af368cba43d4e', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Why Eurasia, Not the Indo-Pacific, Matters Most in Next Phase of Taiwan Deterrence <p>Washington is preparing for the right war, but in the wrong theater. For years, U.S. strategic thinking has centered on the Indo&#8209;Pacific: the militarized atolls of the South China Sea, Chi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/why-eurasia-not-the-indo-pacific-matters-most-in-next-phase-of-taiwan-deterrence/'}, {'signal_id': '0dfdfc89ad8a5bd8', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Latin America’s Balancing Act: Washington, Beijing, and the Post-Maduro Environment <p>The year 2026 has brought sweeping change to Latin America&#8217;s relationship with the United States. Following a major military buildup in the Caribbean and strikes against vessels suspected', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/latin-americas-balancing-act-washington-beijing-and-the-post-maduro-environment/'}, {'signal_id': '8944db22e6d28bad', 'source': 'wa